# Korriban, Yuthura slain (K1): the final test's other end. Uthar's test
# turned as on the main route (with Yuthura against him), but when she
# yields she is killed, not spared. Her death opens the tomb's doors only
# because Uthar, long faded, counts as dead (`GetIsDead` of no object, as
# Aurora's). Starts from the main route's checkpoint at the Star Map:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @kor_starmap data/routes/k1/korriban_yuthura_slain.route --god
say mercy? you won't find any here!   # whichever yield she offers: no mercy
say i have no problem with that
to k39_trg_initacid
fight 30
talk
fight 30
save kor_ys_exam
exit kor39_kor36            # out through the valley and the academy
to k36_trg_shywyrm
exit kor36_kor35
fight 30
exit kor35_kor33b
exit kor33b_kor33a
exit k33_trg_ebonhawk       # aboard
use GalaxyMap               # the Star Maps' coordinates: the Unknown World
travel 9
talk
talk
turrets                  # m12ab: the fighters; the disruptor field, the crash
talk                     # (played before the checkpoint: no save in a
talk                     # minigame)
save kor_ys_unknown_world
